      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RIPPIN' PEDRO (5) is progressing well scoring last time out (16.86) at this track and bringing up his 16th career win. Form here at the trip sound including two wins. Some good form is emerging from his last run. Shapes as a top winning chance on latest effort. PAW MANTRA (4) was in the minors two back (17.12) at this track but ran below best last time there, finishing 6th. Cannot be left out. CERISE (2) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (17.46) in a Other at this track. Has a good record here at this journey. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from five starts. Likely to be thereabouts. SHINY PISTOL (8) is a last start winner and can go on with it.",
